# Fig.7 low-capacity profile (~200s): keep Link1 static at 10 Mbps via
# --scenario fig7_lowcap, and change Link2 capacity by phase.
# Server-side path_b egress (h2-eth1) so pull / download (h2->h1) is rate-limited.
#   0-50s:   10 mbit
#   50-100s: 15 mbit
#   100s-:   5 mbit
IFACE=h2-eth1

0 10
50 15
100 5
